Z||000007||ChadMan||12-26-2000||11:37 AM||||I admire that guy's engineering know-how and the effort he put into that car.  But I fail to see how a 60% increase in curb weight and a 65% decrease in range is worth the effort - even if the solar power is free.  And I see by his plates that this guy lives in Illinois, so I'm guessing most days there isn't enough sun to charge his car!<P>Until they come up with an electric car that will perform as well as an internal-combustion engine, with batteries that are either cheap to replace or will last the life of the car, I will keep burning dead dinosaurs.||||reg||13
